<title>POLAND: PLI AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>PLI AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.29 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.48 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.39 vs   0.05 loss</p>
